{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Into The Light",
    "steam_appid": 1427040,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427040/extras/8d8d5f20f55f292f9aee33f376fd14ab.poster.avif?t=1730099736\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427040/extras/8d8d5f20f55f292f9aee33f376fd14ab.webm?t=1730099736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427040/extras/8d8d5f20f55f292f9aee33f376fd14ab.mp4?t=1730099736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i><br>Damien is driving fast, drunk. He loses control of his car and nothing happens. He wakes up at a petrol station, and the first person he meets is a mysterious figure who invites him to follow him. </i><br><br>Manipulated, lost and full of anxiety, he has to keep moving forward to<strong> stay in the light and survive</strong>. Discover his link with this new horrific world and its new rules.<br><br>You'll have to explore many places beyond reality. But the game's greatest enigma is its storyline and understanding where it's taking you. <br><br>Accompanied by a mysterious protagonist, discover Damien's story and why he is on this terrifying adventure.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427040/extras/4441d1e5d68feed488b9fc3953ebbdc5.poster.avif?t=1730099736\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427040/extras/4441d1e5d68feed488b9fc3953ebbdc5.webm?t=1730099736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427040/extras/4441d1e5d68feed488b9fc3953ebbdc5.mp4?t=1730099736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Into The Light is a<strong> puzzle game</strong> that aims to immerse you in a<strong> horrific atmosphere</strong>. Knowledge of the environment and how you react to it is the key to getting through. You'll play with<strong> environmental mechanics, finding objects and combining them</strong> to solve the puzzles of this new world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427040/extras/a653ddc3ea1397b5224b1b32830bfaf6.poster.avif?t=1730099736\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427040/extras/a653ddc3ea1397b5224b1b32830bfaf6.webm?t=1730099736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427040/extras/a653ddc3ea1397b5224b1b32830bfaf6.mp4?t=1730099736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You'll travel to different locations, each with its own story to help you solve the puzzles of Into The Light. <strong>Darkness is your main enemy, and it will do anything to keep you in it.</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427040/extras/8d8d5f20f55f292f9aee33f376fd14ab.poster.avif?t=1730099736\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427040/extras/8d8d5f20f55f292f9aee33f376fd14ab.webm?t=1730099736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427040/extras/8d8d5f20f55f292f9aee33f376fd14ab.mp4?t=1730099736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i><br>Damien is driving fast, drunk. He loses control of his car and nothing happens. He wakes up at a petrol station, and the first person he meets is a mysterious figure who invites him to follow him. </i><br><br>Manipulated, lost and full of anxiety, he has to keep moving forward to<strong> stay in the light and survive</strong>. Discover his link with this new horrific world and its new rules.<br><br>You'll have to explore many places beyond reality. But the game's greatest enigma is its storyline and understanding where it's taking you. <br><br>Accompanied by a mysterious protagonist, discover Damien's story and why he is on this terrifying adventure.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427040/extras/4441d1e5d68feed488b9fc3953ebbdc5.poster.avif?t=1730099736\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427040/extras/4441d1e5d68feed488b9fc3953ebbdc5.webm?t=1730099736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427040/extras/4441d1e5d68feed488b9fc3953ebbdc5.mp4?t=1730099736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Into The Light is a<strong> puzzle game</strong> that aims to immerse you in a<strong> horrific atmosphere</strong>. Knowledge of the environment and how you react to it is the key to getting through. You'll play with<strong> environmental mechanics, finding objects and combining them</strong> to solve the puzzles of this new world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427040/extras/a653ddc3ea1397b5224b1b32830bfaf6.poster.avif?t=1730099736\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427040/extras/a653ddc3ea1397b5224b1b32830bfaf6.webm?t=1730099736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427040/extras/a653ddc3ea1397b5224b1b32830bfaf6.mp4?t=1730099736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You'll travel to different locations, each with its own story to help you solve the puzzles of Into The Light. <strong>Darkness is your main enemy, and it will do anything to keep you in it.</strong>",
    "short_description": "Stay in the light, beware of the dark. Survive as Damien in a strange world with new rules and horrific residents. Each new step might lead you to madness but your path to salvation has a cost.",
